name textualicomma
category Package
revision 67201
shortdesc Use the textual comma character as decimal separator in math mode
relocated 1
longdesc The package is based on the icomma package, and intended as a
longdesc solution for situations where the text comma character discerns
longdesc from the math comma character, e. g. when fonts whithout math
longdesc support are involved. Escaping to text mode every time a comma
longdesc is used in math mode may slow down the compilation process.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/textualicomma/textualicomma.sty
catalogue-also icomma
catalogue-contact-bugs https://gitlab.com/SFr682k/textualicomma/-/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/SFr682k/textualicomma
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/textualicomma
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics typesetting maths
catalogue-version 1.1
